Container Cross-Install Blobs for x86_64
========================================

This directory should contain:

  bzImage            - Linux kernel for QEMU x86_64
  initramfs.cpio.gz  - Unified initramfs with Docker + Podman tools

These blobs are used by container-cross-install to bundle containers
into Yocto images at build time.

TO POPULATE (one-time):

  MACHINE=qemux86-64 bitbake container-cross-initramfs-build

  cp tmp/deploy/images/qemux86-64/container-cross-initramfs/bzImage .
  cp tmp/deploy/images/qemux86-64/container-cross-initramfs/initramfs.cpio.gz .

If blobs are not checked in, users must build them before using
container-cross-install. The build will fail with instructions if
blobs are missing.
